        "t6": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Fabric & fit",
            "open": false,
            "body": "<p>Seamless knit in an opaque, stretchy, breathable and ultra-soft fabric. Raised 3D lines run over the hips, glutes and thighs, with gentle compression that lifts and shapes.</p><p>The high waistband does not roll down. Nine sizes, US 2 to US 30+: open the Size Guide above to find yours. Between two sizes? Pick the larger one.</p>"
          }
        },
        "t7": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How to wear it",
            "open": false,
            "body": "<p>Made to be worn all day: at home, at work or for a workout.</p><p>Pull them up to your natural waist and smooth the 3D lines over your hips and thighs so they sit where they are knitted. Pair them with a crop top, a sports bra or a long tee.</p>"
          }
        },
        "t8": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Delivery & returns",
            "open": false,
            "body": "<p>Delivery takes 7 to 15 days depending on your location. The shipping cost is shown at checkout, before you pay.</p><p>You have 45 days from delivery to return your order for a refund. See our <a href=\"{{RefundLink}}\">Refund Policy</a>.</p>"
          }
        }
